<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "When a channel is moderated, only owners, operators, half-operators and voiced users can send messages. Regular members can still read but not write."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "When to use it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Use it for talks, interviews, question sessions and announcements. A few people speak and everyone else listens. It is also a quick way to calm a channel during a flood or a heated argument."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Usage")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/mode +m       {dgettext("help_channels", "Enable moderated mode")}
/mode -m       {dgettext("help_channels", "Disable moderated mode")}
/mode +v Nick  {dgettext("help_channels", "Give voice to a user")}
/voice Nick    {dgettext("help_channels", "Give voice to a user")}</pre>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "The command changes the channel you are looking at. You do not type the channel name."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "How it works")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "A regular member who tries to speak gets an error that says they need voice."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Members keep reading everything, and they can still join and leave."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Half-operators, operators and owners can give voice to members who should speak."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "In a registered channel, people on the ChanServ voice list receive voice when they join."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_general}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Channel Central")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Moderated and choose Apply Modes."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Rules and limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Only channel operators and owners can set or remove this mode.")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "In a registered channel the mode is saved and comes back after a restart."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_channels", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="mode-v">{dgettext("help_channels", "Voice")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-voice">/voice</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="chanserv-access">{dgettext("help_channels", "Access Lists")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="channel-modes-overview">
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Channel Modes Overview")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
